{"4689230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Market Manager Simulator", "steam_appid": 4689230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4920830], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market Manager Simulator is a detailed and immersive business simulation game where you build and grow your own supermarket from scratch. Starting with a small shop, it’s entirely up to you to stock shelves, set prices, satisfy customers, and expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you order products to supply your store, unload them from trucks, and place them on shelves. Shelf organization and product variety directly affect customer behavior. With the right pricing strategies, you can increase your profits and experience competitive market management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come to your store, pick products from the shelves, and head to the checkout. At the register, you need to scan items one by one and process payments. Managing both cash and card payments quickly and accurately is crucial for customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your market doesn’t stop there. With the warehouse system, you can stock products and keep your inventory under control. Additionally, the <strong>online shopping system</strong> allows customers to place orders through a website. You can prepare these orders and personally deliver them to customers across the city to earn extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the money you earn, you can expand your market and warehouse, and customize areas such as walls, floors, and ceilings to reflect your own style. As your workload increases, you can hire employees such as cashiers, cleaners, and couriers to make your business more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features an equipment upgrade system. You can upgrade your trucks and carts to complete tasks faster and more efficiently. However, don’t forget to balance expenses such as rent and bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, some customers carry rare <strong>gold bags</strong>. By collecting these, you can use a tablet-based spin wheel system and win extra money rewards depending on your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its detailed mechanics, freedom of gameplay, and realistic market management experience, Market Manager Simulator invites you to become the boss of your own business.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market Manager Simulator is a detailed and immersive business simulation game where you build and grow your own supermarket from scratch. Starting with a small shop, it’s entirely up to you to stock shelves, set prices, satisfy customers, and expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you order products to supply your store, unload them from trucks, and place them on shelves. Shelf organization and product variety directly affect customer behavior. With the right pricing strategies, you can increase your profits and experience competitive market management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come to your store, pick products from the shelves, and head to the checkout. At the register, you need to scan items one by one and process payments. Managing both cash and card payments quickly and accurately is crucial for customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your market doesn’t stop there. With the warehouse system, you can stock products and keep your inventory under control. Additionally, the <strong>online shopping system</strong> allows customers to place orders through a website. You can prepare these orders and personally deliver them to customers across the city to earn extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the money you earn, you can expand your market and warehouse, and customize areas such as walls, floors, and ceilings to reflect your own style. As your workload increases, you can hire employees such as cashiers, cleaners, and couriers to make your business more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features an equipment upgrade system. You can upgrade your trucks and carts to complete tasks faster and more efficiently. However, don’t forget to balance expenses such as rent and bills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, some customers carry rare <strong>gold bags</strong>. By collecting these, you can use a tablet-based spin wheel system and win extra money rewards depending on your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/extras_big/8ce0420dd2edbc463126b1eb3457093e.webp?t=1787324845 width=1560 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its detailed mechanics, freedom of gameplay, and realistic market management experience, Market Manager Simulator invites you to become the boss of your own business.</p>", "short_description": "Build and manage your own market. Fill the shelves, set prices, serve customers, manage online orders and grow your business. Hire employees, check stocks and turn your market into a large business.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Lithuanian, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/123c99a573191f18f07656bbb3f55ce373885b7b/header.jpg?t=1787324845", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/5ec54efa86317865a87a27754036fea167992f75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787324845", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689230/5ec54efa86317865a87a27754036fea167992f75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787324845", "website": "https://bugurcagamestudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570K / AMD FX-8310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bugurca Game Studio"], "publishers": ["PlayWay S.A."], "demos": [{"appid": 4920830, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam